{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安，蘭華小姐！」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2546", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，是你們啊……」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0452", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由於安潔也贊成，隔天星期二我們起了個大早。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比平常提早到校，並且拜訪了學園長。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你們這麼早就到學校了啊。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0453", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，幸好蘭華小姐也在，安潔鬆了一口氣……呼。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2547", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天下午也來了好幾次，但是蘭華小姐都不在。」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2548", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊抱歉抱歉，我有點忙。老實說我好久沒回到這裡了呢。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0454", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔有麻煩愛理同學傳郵件給您～」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2549", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，我想說愛理的事情之後再問就好，所以都沒看，啊哈哈。」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0455", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣還能見上一面真是太好了……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長以前曾說她「沒什麼時間」，看來接近年尾她又更忙了。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天早早放棄，隔天一早來突襲果然是正確決定。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為這樣，讓主人這兩天都早起了。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2550", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「關於這個，我已經得到１０成了。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，其實安潔到現在還心跳得好快。」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2551", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼意思～？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0456", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是秘密！換個說法的話就是我們之間的私事！」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2552", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好曖昧的說法喔♪兩人之間的私事。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0457", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「禁禁禁禁禁止您再追問了！」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2553", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "幾乎等於說出來了啊……", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過害羞沒辦法談正事。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想到的點子無論如何都需要有學園長的許可。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，學園長。可以借我們一點時間嗎？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛……５分鐘左右的話。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0458", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長瞄向時鐘，表情有一瞬間嚴肅。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她今早也是很忙碌。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果沒有剛才那些談笑，就能再多一點時間了，抱歉喔。」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0459", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，是安潔說了多餘的話！？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2554", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "各種意義上，是。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭解了。安潔，既然如此。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的，那就立刻切換狀態，單刀直入地說了！」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2555", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔挺直背脊，直視著學園長開口說。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以配合休業式，做一個很大的聖誕蛋糕嗎？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2556", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長愣了一秒。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……什麼意思？」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0460", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「具體來說，就是讓安潔在休業式中分送蛋糕給全部的學生。」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這就是我昨天的提案。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔轉頭看我，露出燦爛的笑容。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……安潔，現在非常幸福。和主人一起，每天都很幸福地生活著。」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2557", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這些都是這所學校、以及學校裡大家的功勞……」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2558", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔想要感謝報答大家，所以提出這個方法。」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2559", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請大家吃聖誕蛋糕啊。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0461", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然比聖誕節早了幾天就是了。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是這種事，有個華麗的名目很重要嘛。」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再加上慰勞同學們第二學期辛苦了，這三層意義，希望能讓大家開心！」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2560", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原來如此。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0462", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長笑著把背靠在椅背上，一副「說得詳細點」的感覺。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是學校的工作，而是妳個人的意願啊。」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0463", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2561", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……還有，如果做蛋糕的話，主人也能一起做。」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2562", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔紅著臉說。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，我會小心不要扯後腿的。」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天早上感覺只是讓您陪著安潔，感覺很不好意思。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2563", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛋糕就可以一起做了呢！」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2564", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我會努力的……一起加油吧！」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是！」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2565", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是只有安潔或只有我，而是兩個人一起的感謝。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然是安潔先注意到了能夠這樣……", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「兩個人一起」的感謝對我們來說，或許是最重要的事情。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為我們是兩個人一起幸福的。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且……全部的人一起吃蛋糕，我覺得也很有意義。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然也可以一個人一個人分別表達感謝，不過……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2566", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能夠分享同樣的東西，感覺就更棒了！」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2567", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──因為我們理解到分享同樣的感情有多麼快樂。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們兩個人低下頭一起向學園長請求。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，拜託了學園長。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以許可這件事嗎？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2568", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔嗯……」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0464", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長微笑著長吁了一口氣。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她彎下腰拿起皮包，在裡面翻找著什麼……", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接著她掏出鈔票，放在桌子上。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……蘭華小姐？」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這次是我們愣住了。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，因為我有點忙，所以什麼都沒辦法幫忙。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0465", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說是補償有點那個，不過材料費由我出吧，拿去。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0466", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果說你們是要感謝學校和大家的話，那我則是想感謝你們呢。」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0467", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長露齒一笑。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，至今為止因為有妳在，幫了我很多，我也很開心、很快樂喔。」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0468", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而讓這樣的安潔『幸福』的小新吾，我也謝謝你。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0469", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蘭、蘭、蘭華小姐……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "ag2570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 277, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我許可了！」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0470", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長高聲說。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在很幸福──就讓學校裡的大家看看吧！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 283, "voice": "rk0471", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝您！！」「謝謝您！！」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾／安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "ag2571", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們又再次對學園長低頭行禮。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
